    {
      "text": "Ammon1 meets the king in Shilom, Mosiah 7:7. city of Shilom is given to Zeniff by Lamanite king, Mosiah 7:21. Shilom is possessed by Zeniff, Mosiah 9:6. walls of city of Shilom are repaired, Mosiah 9:8. Lamanites steal flocks in Shilom, Mosiah 9:14. Lamanites come upon Shilom, Mosiah 10:8. Lamanite army attacks, is repulsed, Mosiah 10:19–20. tower and buildings are built in Shilom, Mosiah 11:12–13. Limhi’s people travel around Shilom during escape, Mosiah 22:8–11. Amulon and brethren are made teachers over people in Shilom, Mosiah 24:1. Lamanites in Shilom are converted, Alma 23:8, 12.",
